---
import UseCase from '../../components/UseCase.astro';
---

<UseCase
  source="startups"
  seoTitle="AI CMO for startups — marketing on autopilot for founders"
  seoDescription="AICMO is an AI Chief Marketing Officer for early-stage startups and apps: brand positioning, launch plans, LinkedIn and X posts, tracked links and app growth tools. From ₹999/month."
  eyebrow="For startups & apps"
  title="Marketing that keeps shipping"
  accent="while you build the product."
  intro="You don't need a marketing hire to show up every week. AICMO learns your product from your website, writes a positioning and a plan, and keeps LinkedIn, X and your community channels active — with you approving every post."
  pains={[
    ['Founder-led, founder-limited', 'You know the story best, but you only have time to tell it when there is a launch. Then it goes quiet.'],
    ['No marketing hire yet', 'An agency retainer is hard to justify before product-market fit, and a freelancer needs briefing every week.'],
    ['What is working?', 'Posts go out, some do well, and nobody has time to figure out why or do more of it.'],
  ]}
  capabilities={[
    ['Positioning & strategy', "A positioning statement, messaging pillars, target audience and weekly cadence written from what's actually on your site."],
    ['Build-in-public posts', 'Product updates, founder stories, lessons and customer problems turned into LinkedIn and X posts in your voice.'],
    ['Repurpose anything', 'Paste a blog post, changelog or investor update and get channel-ready posts for every network in one go.'],
    ['App growth tools', 'Tracked links and deep links to your Play Store / App Store listing, install attribution, review import and reply drafts.'],
    ['20+ ready documents', 'Launch playbooks, ASO plans, referral programmes, pitch deck outlines, investor updates, press kits and more.'],
    ['Growth experiments', 'Plan an experiment, track it with links or manual numbers, and get a plain-English readout of whether it won.'],
  ]}
  week={[
    ['Monday', "Ask your AI CMO: “Plan this week around our new onboarding feature.” It drafts LinkedIn, X and community posts for the week."],
    ['Tuesday', 'You approve the drafts on your phone between calls. Two go to LinkedIn, three to X, one to your Discord.'],
    ['Thursday', 'You paste your changelog. AICMO repurposes it into a thread and a LinkedIn post with a tracked link to the app.'],
    ['Next Monday', 'It shows which posts drove clicks and installs, and plans more of what worked.'],
  ]}
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is this only for apps?', a: 'No. SaaS, services and consumer startups all use the same core: Brand Brain, strategy, content, approvals and publishing. App tools (tracked links, installs, reviews, ASO) are there when you need them.' },
    { q: 'Which channels matter most for early-stage startups?', a: 'Usually LinkedIn and X for founders, plus one community channel (Discord, Telegram or Slack). AICMO lets you start with those and add more later.' },
    { q: 'Will it sound like AI?', a: 'It writes from your Brand Brain — your voice, words to use and avoid, pillars and product facts — and you can edit anything before it goes out. The more you approve and edit, the closer it gets.' },
    { q: 'Can my co-founder approve posts too?', a: 'Yes. Growth includes 2 team members and Pro includes 10.' },
  ]}
  related={[
    ['A 30-day social media content plan for startups', '/blog/30-day-social-media-content-plan-for-startups'],
    ['AI CMO vs agency vs freelancer', '/blog/ai-cmo-vs-agency-vs-freelancer'],
  ]}
/>
